      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "lines": [
        9,
        9
      ],
      "raw": "From time to time, a security will change its ticker symbol. This could be a result of a merger, acquisition, a name change, or other reasons. This will create a ` positions.updated` event including the previous symbol and the new symbol (`current`).",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "From time to time, a security will change its ticker symbol. This could be a result of a merger, acquisition, a name change, or other reasons. This will create a  positions.updated event including the previous symbol and the new symbol (current).",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
